(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-70","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["传真写着[[inland|内陆的]]配载方向，管理员的[[specialty|专长]]使杂乱单据变得[[coherent|条理清楚]]。旧研究站的[[intercourse|交往]]对象不只博物馆，校方也收过物资。馆员保持[[decency|得体]]，仍要[[ponder|考虑]]谁签了最后的[[composite|混合的]]箱。风不会停止，不能让它[[hinder|阻碍]]我们查纸。航线[[suspension|暂停]]带来的[[frustration|挫败]]是真实的，站长趁机[[hustle|催促]]工人撤异议，旧维修工则准备[[sue|起诉]]索赔。他捂着[[belly|肚子]]说昨夜没吃东西，老陈先给他拿饭，不让调查又变成叫他空着肚子回答。","我能[[recite|背诵]]所有箱号，却仍不懂它们怎样[[oppress|压住]]人的声音。午后[[gloom|昏暗]]里，馆员从[[closet|壁橱]]搬出研究者遗物，但我们不能随意[[dismantle|拆开]]柜底。她笑说不用假装[[prescient|有预见]]，这次[[revelation|新发现]]来自[[innumerable|无数的]]日常登记。家属回复可能[[elicit|引出]]最后的转运联；别把他们[[relegate|降为]]一条[[trivial|无关紧要的]]线索。研究者的[[burial|葬礼]]已多年过去，家属第一次被问的却是父亲那些报损有没有被保留。馆员把问题原样传过去，没有先说我们的案子比他们的记忆更要紧。","她[[conscientious|认真]]地把照片[[tuck|夹入]]防水袋，得到家属许可后[[extract|取出]]捐赠册。基金的[[preview|预告片]]曾让家属充满[[dismay|失望]]，因为旧仪器被说成新发现；他们填过[[questionnaire|问卷]]反对，从未得到答复。此刻的[[breakthrough|突破]]不应牺牲[[privacy|隐私]]，我们约定[[reciprocal|相互的]]核对，只公开物资。捐赠[[inventory|清单]]末页有一笔[[flush|齐平的]]盖章痕，与馆员底册缺口相同。她把纸举向灯，解释这并非真的同一天盖章，旧章一角损坏后来才修，日期因而可以分出前后。","研究者[[heir|继承人]]留下旧检测[[kit|成套工具]]的运输页，基金的[[turnover|营业额]]并未记录它曾两次出售。新闻[[coverage|报道]]只说资源重生，但[[corrupt|腐败的]]做法不能被一段捐赠话术[[preclude|排除]]。家属原想[[commemorate|纪念]]父亲，不是给[[premature|仓促的]]验收作背书。他读出[[periodical|期刊]]里早年的设备规格，缺少一只[[accessory|配件]]，而半岛出货照仍少同一只。这个吻合不能证明内容没变，却让我们找到了需要扣留核查的实箱，比从几十盏夜船灯里选一盏可靠得多。","消息会[[electrify|使人激动]]，馆员却先看清传真[[fringe|边缘]]，发现一行被剪掉的退库指示。那句[[dreadful|糟糕的]]话要求把未核验箱送到‘校史教育补给线’。一名[[militant|好斗的]]经理说读史的人只爱找麻烦，我没有与他吵。我请半岛管理员按实箱号核对：不是所有去学校的货都危险，特定箱不能只靠换名就过关。传真另一端很久没有声音，接着发来一张轨道交货凭证。柜子里的原表不再止于海岛，路线向内陆分叉，且分叉不是风雨造成，而是风雨到来前已有人安排。","叶澄通过何警官转来南渠旧验收页的一张角照，说有同样的调度印。她仍未交完整页，因为那里有自己的签字；我压着火气，约定回大陆后当面核对。赵启先比照港务原档，确认印章属于基金承包运输，不属于原案的闸房操作。父亲的结论没有被这份传真改变，新线也不能借旧案的愤怒跳过核对。夜里轮渡试航仍停，我们给内陆车站发出特定箱暂停混装的通知，由港务正式接续。下一章要收齐岛站原页的移交记录，等一条安全的回程，而不是在最后一点风里夺一场不必要的胜利。"],"en":["A fax named an [[inland|inland]] yard. The keeper's [[specialty|specialty]] made forms [[coherent|coherent]]. Research [[intercourse|intercourse]] included schools as well as the museum. With [[decency|decency]] the curator would [[ponder|ponder]] the final [[composite|composite]] box signature. Wind must not [[hinder|hinder]] paperwork. Sailing [[suspension|suspension]] brought [[frustration|frustration]]; the director tried to [[hustle|hustle]] workers into withdrawals. The former technician planned to [[sue|sue]] for compensation. Holding his [[belly|belly]], he admitted missing meals. Chen brought food before further questioning.","I could [[recite|recite]] numbers without understanding how they [[oppress|oppress]] speech. In afternoon [[gloom|gloom]] the curator moved relics from a [[closet|closet]]; we would not freely [[dismantle|dismantle]] it. No [[prescient|prescient]] guesses were needed. This [[revelation|revelation]] emerged from [[innumerable|innumerable]] daily entries. Family replies might [[elicit|elicit]] a transfer copy; they must not [[relegate|relegate]] relatives to [[trivial|trivial]] clues. Years after the scientist's [[burial|burial]], someone finally asked whether damage reports survived. She relayed that question without claiming our case outranked their memories.","[[conscientious|Conscientious]] packing allowed her to [[tuck|tuck]] photographs away and, with consent, [[extract|extract]] the donation ledger. A fund [[preview|preview]] had caused [[dismay|dismay]]: old instruments became new discoveries. An unanswered [[questionnaire|questionnaire]] objected. Our [[breakthrough|breakthrough]] must preserve [[privacy|privacy]] through [[reciprocal|reciprocal]] checks and disclosure of goods alone. An [[inventory|inventory]] stamp was [[flush|flush]] with an edge, its missing corner matching museum copies. The stamp had later been repaired, allowing dates to be separated even though forms claimed one day.","The [[heir|heir]] supplied an old testing [[kit|kit]] transport page; fund [[turnover|turnover]] omitted two sales. [[coverage|Coverage]] celebrated renewal, but donation language could not [[preclude|preclude]] scrutiny of [[corrupt|corrupt]] practice. To [[commemorate|commemorate]] his father was not to endorse [[premature|premature]] acceptance. A [[periodical|periodical]] specification named a missing [[accessory|accessory]], also absent in peninsula photographs. Matching did not prove unchanged contents, but identified the box requiring detention far better than selecting a light among night vessels.","News might [[electrify|electrify]] us. The curator first examined a fax's [[fringe|fringe]] and found a trimmed instruction. Its [[dreadful|dreadful]] requirement sent unchecked boxes to a school-history supply route. A [[militant|militant]] manager dismissed historians as troublemakers. I requested physical-number checks without accusing every school-bound item. After silence came a rail delivery voucher. Originals now connected beyond the island. That fork had been planned before weather arrived, rather than caused by the storm.","Through He, Ye Cheng sent a corner of her Southern Canal acceptance sheet bearing the same dispatch stamp. She withheld the full signed page; I restrained anger and arranged a mainland meeting. Zhao checked original port records: the stamp belonged to contracted fund transport, not the old gatehouse operation. Neither my father's findings nor this new route justified skipped checks. Trial sailings remained suspended. Port officials sent a specific-box mixing halt to the inland station. Next we would complete island custody records and await a safe return."]});
